: SSE fixture: a stream cut off mid-frame. The last frame announces an
: event but never delivers its data line, so the parser drops it and the
: adapter reports an incomplete stream.


event: progress
data: {"type": "progress", "node": "planner", "data": {"heading": "Planning the work"}}

event: usage
data: {"type": "usage", "node": "answer", "data": {"details": {"input_tokens": 30, "output_tokens": 10, "total_tokens": 40, "role": "execute"}}}

event: complete
